# Part of ZacUI. These files were lifted out of the main addon so this
# piece can be switched off in the AddOns list on its own. They share
# ZacUI's namespace (_G.ZacUI, published by Core_Boot) and its saved
# variables; every setting still lives in ZacUIDB and in profiles.
# Load order within this file is the same as it was inside ZacUI.

AB_Core.lua
AB_ActionBars.lua
AB_Extras.lua
AB_Import.lua
AB_Loadouts.lua
AB_Preview.lua
Config_PagesBars.lua
